# Intentionally empty — do NOT ignore anything at the repository root.
#
# A previous version of this file kept only `apps/web` and excluded everything
# else. Because `.vercelignore` is shared by every Vercel project in this repo,
# it also stripped `apps/api` from the API project's deployment, so its build
# failed with: ENOENT apps/api/package.json (npm install).
#
# Both the web and api projects build fine with the full repo present (this was
# the state before the file was added). If the web deployment ever needs to be
# slimmed down, do it via that project's Vercel settings (Root Directory /
# ignored build step), not this shared root file.
